      "700"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Five studies on invertebrates found increases in abundance or species richness of some invertebrates due to agri-environment schemes.",
    "citations": [
      "700"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "For wild bees, four replicated trials in Europe showed enhanced diversity and/or abundance of foraging wild bees on land managed under various European agri-environment schemes.",
